    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beats Of Fury is a mix of Rhythm games and bullet-hell shooters with a psychedelic atmosphere, start shooting the evil beats creating the best of music while getting your fingers smashed and your head twisted. <br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727450/extras/95977f1cb5970131f04061a303fa540d.poster.avif?t=1746126619\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727450/extras/95977f1cb5970131f04061a303fa540d.webm?t=1746126619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727450/extras/95977f1cb5970131f04061a303fa540d.mp4?t=1746126619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">For photosensitive people :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the game effects can be controlled or totally turned off while playing the game or from the options menu.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Current Features :\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story mode</strong>: currently including 12 handcrafted levels (more to be added) across 2 worlds.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rock world</strong>: includes Rock,Post-Rock and Metal music.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Electronic world</strong> : includes EDM, Trap, and House music.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mix it Mode</strong> : A mode in which the players will be able to play all the game music endlessly shuffling between them to compete with other players on leaderboard.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leaderboard</strong>: to compete with other players on each of the 4 difficulties.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Audio visualization</strong> : this means that you will feel and experience every beat in the music at the deepest level possible.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple ways to play</strong>: Xbox Controller, Mouse and Keyboard, or just Keyboard.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No aiming mode</strong> : A new mode for casual players.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Color blind mode</strong> :  Choose from different settings for color-blind people.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Incoming Features : <strong>Custom mode</strong>: A mode in which the player can put his own music using youtube or other technology like mp3 files </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727450/extras/a301efd4c551c73542aa90b1f2922c18.poster.avif?t=1746126619\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727450/extras/a301efd4c551c73542aa90b1f2922c18.webm?t=1746126619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727450/extras/a301efd4c551c73542aa90b1f2922c18.mp4?t=1746126619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
