sible.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple ways to play</strong>: Xbox Controller, Mouse and Keyboard, or just Keyboard.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No aiming mode</strong> : A new mode for casual players.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Color blind mode</strong> :  Choose from different settings for color-blind people.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Incoming Features : <strong>Custom mode</strong>: A mode in which the player can put his own music using youtube or other technology like mp3 files </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727450/extras/a301efd4c551c73542aa90b1f2922c18.poster.avif?t=1746126619\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727450/extras/a301efd4c551c73542aa90b1f2922c18.webm?t=1746126619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727450/extras/a301efd4c551c73542aa90b1f2922c18.mp4?t=1746126619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
